    {
      "id": 209404,
      "name": "Phantom5613",
      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-11-24T14:55:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you're considering Table-top RPGs, then I'm looking to get Deadlands Noir and whatever companion books they have. My one friend borrowed my first copy so he could run a game, but he took it with him when he moved.</p><p>I bought my nephew 'Ghost Fightin' Treasure Hunters' for Christmas. He tried it at a local library event, and he really seemed to like it. The game looks great for playing with kids, but still fun for adults to play too.&nbsp;It wone an award in 2014 I think, and it seems to be so popular that they made&nbsp;a 'Ghostbusters' re-skin of the game called 'Ghostbusters: Protect the Barrier'.</p><p>'Mysterium' is cool, it plays something like Clue if you were playing it backwards... I'd also like to maybe get Clue. Every game cabinet needs Clue(Or Clue-do, for our friends across the pond). Ah, and while we're talking about classics with a twist, 'Monopoly Gamer' is super fun. And it doesn't make me want to kill the friend I'm playing with...</p><p>There's 'Endangerd Orphans of Condyle Cove', 'Dracula's Feast', 'Are You Mental?'... Wish I could give you more suggestions, but lots of what I want is either still on KS, &nbsp;or hasn't been released yet. :/</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:39:30.742Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 17429,
      "topic_slug": "what-games-are-going-on-your-christmas-list",
      "display_username": "Phantom5613",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
